stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> PENDING_APPROVAL: CCR requires approval
    [*] --> PENDING: Approved before notBefore
    [*] --> VALID: Approved within validity window

    PENDING_APPROVAL --> PENDING: Approved before notBefore
    PENDING_APPROVAL --> VALID: Approved within validity window

    PENDING --> VALID: notBefore reached

    VALID --> PENDING_RENEWAL: renew_by passed without renewal
    VALID --> SCHEDULED_OFFLINE: Entered offline schedule window
    VALID --> EXPIRED: notAfter reached
    VALID --> REVOKED: Revoked by administrator

    PENDING_RENEWAL --> VALID: Renewal recorded
    PENDING_RENEWAL --> EXPIRED: notAfter reached
    PENDING_RENEWAL --> REVOKED: Revoked by administrator

    SCHEDULED_OFFLINE --> VALID: Offline window ended
    SCHEDULED_OFFLINE --> EXPIRED: notAfter reached
    SCHEDULED_OFFLINE --> REVOKED: Revoked by administrator

    EXPIRED --> [*]
    REVOKED --> [*]
